    - target: {fileID: 4407943790353120084, guid: 5566b590cb47e2d47b961c3d2f92df9b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "1: An Eskani plate passed down within a family as a generational keepsake.\n\n2:
        An artisan Cleoni plate displayed within homes and businesses to honor their
        culture and give thanks to the makers of the dish.\n\n3: An urn used by Thebrean
        families. It is common in Thebrean families to cremate a loved one who has
        passed and put their ashes in a decorative urn to show respect to their relatives.
        \r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
